      <h2 class="suite-title reveal" id="properties-title">Every property, and its address.</h2>
      <p class="lede reveal" style="margin-top:18px;max-width:64ch">Each address below resolves to a running site, at the stage named beside it.</p>

      <ul class="properties reveal">
        <li class="property">
          <a class="property__link" href="https://www.lanevector.com" rel="noopener">lanevector.com</a>
          <span class="property__name">Lane Vector</span>
